  {
   "msgid": "Connect to the gateway and pass the tests, in UAT and then PROD. Phase 3, steps [43]-[46] and [60]-[78].",
   "hash": "21cee3aec105bf66",
   "sources": [
    "input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.GoLive.bpmn"
   ],
   "locales": {
    "ar": {
     "text": "الربط ببوابة الربط واجتياز الاختبارات، في UAT ثم في PROD. المرحلة 3، الخطوات [43]-[46] و[60]-[78].",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "es": {
     "text": "Conectarse a la puerta de enlace y superar las pruebas, en UAT y luego en PROD. Fase 3, pasos [43]-[46] y [60]-[78].",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "fr": {
     "text": "Se connecter à la passerelle et réussir les tests, en UAT puis en PROD. Phase 3, étapes [43]-[46] et [60]-[78].",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "ru": {
     "text": "Подключиться к шлюзу и пройти тесты в UAT, а затем в PROD. Этап 3, шаги [43]-[46] и [60]-[78].",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "zh": {
     "text": "先在 UAT、再在 PROD 中连接网关并通过测试。第 3 阶段，步骤 [43]-[46] 和 [60]-[78]。",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "msgid": "Connects the Participant's systems to the Trust Network Gateway and runs the tests (Framework IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/TechnicalRepresentative.",
   "hash": "9e8c77ad5ecf0fb7",
   "sources": [
    "input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.GoLive.bpmn"
   ],
   "locales": {
    "ar": {
     "text": "يربط أنظمة المشارك ببوابة شبكة الثقة ويُجري الاختبارات (الإطار IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/TechnicalRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "es": {
     "text": "Conecta los sistemas del Participante a la puerta de enlace a la red de confianza (TNG) y realiza las pruebas (Marco IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/TechnicalRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "fr": {
     "text": "Connecte les systèmes du participant à la passerelle du réseau de confiance et exécute les tests (Cadre IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/TechnicalRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "ru": {
     "text": "Подключает системы Участника к Шлюзу сети доверия и проводит тесты (Рамочный документ, раздел IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/TechnicalRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "zh": {
     "text": "将参与方的系统连接到信任网络网关并运行测试（《框架》第 IX 节）。ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/TechnicalRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    }
   }
  },
