  {
   "msgid": "Sends the Statement of Interest and the Letter of Application; may meet WHO in person (Framework IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative.",
   "hash": "0d564e26e5995a0f",
   "sources": [
    "input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.GoLive.bpmn"
   ],
   "locales": {
    "ar": {
     "text": "يرسل بيان الاهتمام وخطاب الطلب؛ ويجوز له مقابلة منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) شخصياً (الإطار IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "es": {
     "text": "Envía la Declaración de interés y la Carta de solicitud; puede reunirse en persona con la OMS (Marco IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "fr": {
     "text": "Envoie la déclaration d'intérêt et la lettre de candidature ; peut rencontrer l'OMS en personne (Cadre IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "ru": {
     "text": "Направляет Заявление о заинтересованности и Письмо-заявку; может встретиться с представителями ВОЗ лично (Рамочный документ, раздел IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    },
    "zh": {
     "text": "发送意向声明和申请函；可以与 WHO 当面会晤（《框架》第 IX 节）。ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative.",
     "status": "agent",
     "fuzzy": false,
     "candidates": []
    }
   }
  },
